{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12119","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:14.745659+00:00","comments":[],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348932?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hawkinsp","id":348932,"login":"hawkinsp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0ODkzMg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hawkinsp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"### Description\r\n\r\nAfter assigning GPU to a process using `jax.config.update(\"jax_cuda_visible_devices\", localid)`, `psum` fails with the following error (localid = local process id) (I added additional debug print statement in XLA code to confirm):\r\n\r\n```\r\njaxlib.xla_extension.XlaRuntimeError: INTERNAL: RET_CHECK failure (external/org_tensorflow/tensorflow/compiler/xla/service/gpu/gpu_executable_run_options.cc:75) 0 <= local_device_ordinal && local_device_ordinal < gpu_global_device_ids->size()\r\nlocal_device_ordinal: 3\r\ngpu_global_device_ids size: 1\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote that such a failure doesn't occur if we use `os.environ[\"CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES\"]=localid`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nHere's the repro code:\r\n\r\n```\r\nimport jax\r\nimport os\r\nfrom absl import flags, app\r\n\r\nflags.DEFINE_string('server_addr', 'localhost:54321', help='server ip addr')\r\nflags.DEFINE_integer('num_hosts', 1, help='num of hosts' )\r\nflags.DEFINE_integer('host_idx', 0, help='index of current host' )\r\nFLAGS = flags.FLAGS\r\n\r\ndef main(argv):\r\n    print(FLAGS.server_addr, FLAGS.num_hosts, FLAGS.host_idx)\r\n\r\n    jax.config.update(\"jax_cuda_visible_devices\", str(FLAGS.host_idx))\r\n\r\n    jax.distributed.initialize(FLAGS.server_addr, FLAGS.num_hosts, FLAGS.host_idx)\r\n\r\n\r\n    print(f\"Device count: {jax.device_count()}\")\r\n\r\n    print(f\"Local device count: {jax.local_device_count()}\")\r\n   \r\n    xs = jax.numpy.ones(jax.local_device_count())\r\n    y = jax.pmap(lambda x: jax.lax.psum(x, 'i'), axis_name='i')(xs)\r\n\r\n    print(f\"output: {y}\")\r\n\r\nif __name__ == '__main__':\r\n  app.run(main)\r\n```\r\n\r\nLaunch 4 processes (or any number > 1) within shell as follows\r\n```\r\npython manual_dist.py --server_addr=127.0.0.1:54321 --num_hosts=4 --host_idx=0 &\r\npython manual_dist.py --server_addr=127.0.0.1:54321 --num_hosts=4 --host_idx=1 &\r\npython manual_dist.py --server_addr=127.0.0.1:54321 --num_hosts=4 --host_idx=2 &\r\npython manual_dist.py --server_addr=127.0.0.1:54321 --num_hosts=4 --host_idx=3 &\r\n```\r\n\r\n### What jax/jaxlib version are you using?\r\n\r\njax/jaxlib 0.3.17 (built from head)\r\n\r\n### Which accelerator(s) are you using?\r\n\r\nGPU\r\n\r\n### Additional System Info\r\n\r\nFails when launching multiple processes with 1.) SLURM (srun), 2.) MPI (mpirun) and 3.) shell","closed_at":"2022-08-26T21:33:14Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12119/comments","created_at":"2022-08-26T05:06:03Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/12119/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/12119","id":1351751516,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"is